# Deliberately empty of media.
#
# Anything under apps/web/public is served unauthenticated, so the rendered
# SC2 3D alert media must never live here: it is derived from rights-controlled
# game assets and is restricted to admin accounts. The files are stored in the
# private R2 bucket (sc2tools-alert-media) and reached only through the
# admin-gated presign endpoint. See docs/sc2-alert-render-pipeline.md.
*.webm
*.webp
*.png
!.gitignore
